al as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{|x|\\sqrt{5{x}^{2}-1}}=\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{|\\sqrt{5}x|\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{5}x)^{2}-1}}\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nThis integral now resembles the basic one for $\\text{arcsec},$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}u=\\text{arcsec}(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of $u$ as the variable, we have $\\sqrt{5}x.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\sqrt{5}x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{5}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{5{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{|\\sqrt{5}x|\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{5}x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5}\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5}\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\text{arcsec }u+C \\\\  & =\\text{arcsec}(\\sqrt{5}x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186250174 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4d1c680b-da3e-532e-b768-23a73eed1830" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{arcsec}(x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248115} {:answer/id #uuid "76b64e00-cc9d-56bb-96a5-6ed308000d0f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{arcsec}\\left(\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248469} {:answer/id #uuid "81a2d087-34bd-5b98-b3f9-540414b7de9a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{arcsec}(\\sqrt{2}x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248571} {:answer/id #uuid "a16a9266-9795-55dc-8015-252092435b4f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{arcsec}(\\sqrt{2}x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248867} {:answer/id #uuid "f738a875-32bb-5a84-9c85-9b96cb51105b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :a