}.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{1}{|7 x|\\sqrt{(7 x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 1\\int \\frac{1}{|7 x|\\sqrt{(7 x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 1(\\frac{1}{7})\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{7}\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}}{7}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(7 x \\right)}}{7}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis antiderivative applies on either interval where $|7 x|>1$; the constant may differ between those intervals."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676949 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "006b058a-8757-53b5-9e86-166b3bad3f57" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{4}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676873} {:answer/id #uuid "31a5ba68-5ac7-536c-8c41-f1a5e3abe4fd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676907} {:answer/id #uuid "7f880d5c-a5a7-5504-b0fb-6f1cc67b05ee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(16 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676957} {:answer/id #uuid "cf8e4da3-3b7a-5c40-80b9-cdaba7d45e44" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{16}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186677010} {:answer/id #uuid "d02f031d-3d68-5f84-adca-189e93f397fa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186677012}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d02f031d-3d68-5f84-adca-189e93f397fa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(