t :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676918} {:answer/id #uuid "54a15aad-5ed5-5e4d-ba7e-1c0422c019cd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3 \\sqrt{3} \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(\\sqrt{3} x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676929} {:answer/id #uuid "95e14540-a907-57a9-af56-5c13e9653546" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9 \\sqrt{3} \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(\\sqrt{3} x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676970} {:answer/id #uuid "d6b5ffaf-8545-5b67-a43e-b06901fddd7e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(\\sqrt{3} x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186677014} {:answer/id #uuid "f03be629-e361-57e1-aa79-d89c4c2e71ea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(\\sqrt{3} x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186677027}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f03be629-e361-57e1-aa79-d89c4c2e71ea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(\\sqrt{3} x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186677027} :answer-field/id #uuid "7c2ce00a-b685-5520-b2c9-cc2b514b71f2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676953}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "9109a0e2-f715-5496-8bcd-2bf0c487318b" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{9}{|x|\\sqrt{3 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=\\sqrt{3} x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\sqrt{3},\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nThe substitution factor is positive, so the absolute values satisfy\n\n$$\n|u|=|\\sqrt{3} x|=\\sqrt{3}|x|,\\qquad \\frac{1}{|x|}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{|u|}.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{9}{|x|\\sqrt{3 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 9 \\sqrt{3}\\int \\frac{1}{|\\sqrt{3} x|\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{3} x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 9 \\sqrt{3}(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3})\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 9\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 9 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C \\\\  &= 9 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(\\sqrt{3} x \\right)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis antiderivative applies on either interval where $|\\sqrt{3} x|>1$; the constant may differ between those intervals."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676971 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "13b0f660-67ce-59a2-9cf2-d36d0c375fff" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(10 x \\right)}}{100}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676885} {:answer/id #uuid "1d12d78c-c5a9-5229-adea-c3244ab0d11f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(10 x \\right)}}{10}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676890} {:answer/id #uuid "35f9913b-fc0f-5a49-9eda-f6cec6430dcd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(10 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676911} {:answer/id #uuid "361c11c2-2fa8-565f-b175-a7e910e759d9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(100 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676912} {:answer/id #uuid "ac14cc1a-0019-5315-94d9-d5219638bc74" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(10 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676985}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ac14cc1a-0019-5315-94d9-d5219638bc74" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(10 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676985} :answer-field/id #uuid "d2cf0d9b-76d2-51ef-8dd1-3354fdaf72b5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186677013}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "97af9687-66c6-579d-97d7-01feb5f40f72" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{10}{|10 x|\\sqrt{(10 x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=10 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=10,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{10})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nThe substitution factor is positive, so the absolute values satisfy\n\n$$\n|u|=|10 x|=10|x|,\\qquad \\frac{1}{|x|}=\\frac{10}{|u|}.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{10}{|10 x|\\sqrt{(10 x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 10\\int \\frac{1}{|10 x|\\sqrt{(10 x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 10(\\frac{1}{10})\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 1\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C \\\\  &= \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(10 x \\right)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis antiderivative applies on either interval where $|10 x|>1$; the constant may differ between those intervals."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676973 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0126e7ef-2ec7-5d7f-a8d7-582407009616" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676874} {:answer/id #uuid "26615563-e530-5544-b9f7-a24d5d7c3520" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right