186676982 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0208a87c-e72d-5553-95a3-88676b1900da" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676875} {:answer/id #uuid "20a8febd-4faa-5a89-a1b1-fc75ee1112f9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676895} {:answer/id #uuid "39669edf-52ed-591a-bc4f-05f46c11d86d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{8}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676913} {:answer/id #uuid "a1ad18ec-e783-5a5d-ab40-fe59997cffab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676975} {:answer/id #uuid "a63a8958-2bad-585b-b08f-b28fdffa096b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676981}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a1ad18ec-e783-5a5d-ab40-fe59997cffab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676975} :answer-field/id #uuid "95c1d718-179c-5ae2-9903-11398143c9ae" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676969}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "a8e1e0d2-fc46-5618-9a39-5e6fdde9fc87" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{2|x|\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=2 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nThe substitution factor is positive, so the absolute values satisfy\n\n$$\n|u|=|2 x|=2|x|,\\qquad \\frac{1}{|x|}=\\frac{2}{|u|}.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{1}{2|x|\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 1\\int \\frac{1}{|2 x|\\sqrt{(2 x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 1(\\frac{1}{2})\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= \\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C \\\\  &= \\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis antiderivative applies on either interval where $|2 x|>1$; the constant may differ between those intervals."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676986 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e490206-6d56-5574-9453-0e68c12263f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676894} {:answer/id #uuid "2e5efafe-ae73-5971-940e-1cb481b504a2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676904} {:answer/id #uuid "59ce4e9f-cf5b-5371-8bdb-f1cbcc591855" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676934} {:answer/id #uuid "9129a361-2e73-5adc-96c4-fa751e6d00a4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676968} {:answer/id #uuid "c5017709-422a-585d-8e3d-c3340f483d10" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2 \\operatorname{arctan}{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186677004}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2e5efafe-ae73-5971-940e-1cb481b504a2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676904} :answer-field/id #uuid "f25faa23-2594-5f40-ab0a-2ecce21fbb68" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186677028}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "ad5586bd-92a8-50ea-bd0f-7fa1955e49e8" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{8}{|4 x|\\sqrt{(4 x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Use the linear substitution $u=4 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=4,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nThe substitution factor is positive, so the absolute values satisfy\n\n$$\n|u|=|4 x|=4|x|,\\qquad \\frac{1}{|x|}=\\frac{4}{|u|}.\n$$\n\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int \\frac{8}{|4 x|\\sqrt{(4 x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 8\\int \\frac{1}{|4 x|\\sqrt{(4 x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\  &= 8(\\frac{1}{4})\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 2\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{u^{2}-1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\  &= 2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C \\\\  &= 2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis antiderivative applies on either interval where $|4 x|>1$; the constant may differ between those intervals."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186676997 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "792218b4-1e15-5c28-b955-ccc4600c533e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5 \\sqrt{7} \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(\\sqrt{7} x \\right)}}{7}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186676951} {:answer/id #uuid "a25ceb1a-ae7b-523e-8bb7-b1cce00f19ea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5 \\