nterval where $|2 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant." :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\n\nBecause $2>0$, $|u|=2|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/2$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=1$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186679052 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "252218ad-1c4a-5fdb-acf3-685f2dad3a6e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(10 x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678959} {:answer/id #uuid "47e15b9f-f50c-567d-a1f5-f944fe687c5d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678980} {:answer/id #uuid "75324eed-948f-5ad8-9539-9da66354e951" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679012} {:answer/id #uuid "a731f87b-217d-5532-bca4-d095f70ce817" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679039} {:answer/id #uuid "eab7f8bb-b962-515d-ae13-5b90b484af60" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679087}] :answer-field/correc