uuid "e458c6a7-d57b-5820-90ef-f845411de6d9" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant." :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nBecause $5>0$, $|u|=5|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/5$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $10\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186679091 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2c2e2a1a-3cd6-5c4c-aebd-51d8adce6fcd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678965} {:answer/id #uuid "ae144fb9-7aa6-577c-afcc-9db6f4da3b89" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679044} {:answer/id #uuid "ae2a61db-1b69-5e72-b058-0c91779f9cde" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679045} {:answer/id #uuid "e740253a-8298-