}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186679092 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "22234917-661d-55e6-bf15-1539dc6f1ca9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(6 x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678953} {:answer/id #uuid "40598f69-d38c-580a-ac76-25dd1df1772e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678973} {:answer/id #uuid "4c5be87a-280e-5e27-94d4-760eb3e4efab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678984} {:answer/id #uuid "61ea967d-3662-5112-a401-c106190ec2d8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679001} {:answer/id #uuid "ba785ef5-5dfe-56a4-9972-ec65ecf92308" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679055}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "40598f69-d38c-580a-ac76-25dd1df1772e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678973} :answer-field/id #uuid "d20f1c0e-2f95-59e8-aaf0-a406d464023a" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679075}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "f0669784-ec1f-5ea5-8858-d62b3e3c7a46" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2}{|3 x|\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\